# Evidence discipline

## Repo primacy

This rule **adds** pointers; it does not replace **`phd-research-os.mdc`** or **`000-research-agent-operating-system.mdc`**. Every quantitative claim still needs artifact path, command, seeds/commit when relevant.

## Co-work checklists

- **Evidence packets:** `.ai-cowork/evidence-auditor.md`, `.ai-cowork/evidence-packet-template.md`
- **Adversarial pass:** `.ai-cowork/red-team-critic.md`

## Contract labels (mandatory for parity language)

- Name **contract** (e.g. **C** pre-limit window vs **D** full horizon) and **gate** (**strict** vs **relaxed** vs diagnostic).
- **Bridge** (Python analytical path) vs **native MATLAB** — say which was used; do not imply native ran when only the bridge did.
- Do **not** justify **strict** publication claims with **relaxed** metrics alone.

## Unknowns

Use **pending** / **unknown** instead of inventing metric cells or file paths.
